-- ==========================================================================
-- Kerala Cyber Dome Demo — Online Child Protection Intelligence
-- ==========================================================================
-- Scenario: Kerala Police Cyber Dome monitoring online child exploitation
-- networks, predator activity on social platforms, AI-generated synthetic
-- content, financial trails of exploitation material trade, and cross-platform
-- identity correlation for investigation support.
--
-- Context: Kerala Cyber Dome is India's first dedicated police cyber lab.
-- ACPIA (Agentic Child Protection Investigation Assistant) problem statement
-- from HAC'KP 2026 hackathon maps directly to Anveshak's 5 modules + Engine C.
-- This demo showcases all 12 ACPIA focus areas using Anveshak capabilities.
--
-- NOTE: All content is fictional and focuses on investigation workflows,
-- NOT exploitation material. Content describes surveillance of predator
-- networks, financial trail analysis, and takedown operations.
--
-- Org: org_cyber (reusing existing org for demo user)
-- User: demo_cyber@anveshak.local (existing)
--
-- Idempotent: all INSERTs use ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING.
-- Run: docker exec -i anveshak-postgres-1 psql -U anveshak -d anveshak < scripts/seed_kerala_demo.sql
-- ==========================================================================

