('kl-ci-23','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-01','https://thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/upi-network-exploitation','UPI payment network linked to exploitation trade','The Hindu: Kerala Police Cyber Dome traces UPI payment network used for trading exploitation material. 15 UPI IDs identified operating as a payment ring. Amounts small (Rs 200-500) to avoid detection. Total volume estimated at Rs 12 lakh over 6 months. RBI notified. Bank accounts frozen under Section 69 IT Act.', md5('kl-ci-23'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '25 days',85.0,'kl-cl-03','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"The Hindu","author_id":"kl-src-01","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.7,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["UPI","payment network","exploitation","RBI","bank accounts","Section 69"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '25 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-24','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-06','https://t.me/cybercrime_alert_kl/108','Crypto wallet cluster analysis','INTEL: Blockchain analysis reveals cluster of 8 Bitcoin wallets used for exploitation material purchases on dark web. Wallets connected through common mixing service. Total flow: 2.3 BTC (~Rs 1.5 crore). One wallet (bc1q_fake_wallet_1) traced to Indian exchange KYC. Shared with ED for financial investigation.', md5('kl-ci-24'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '23 days',22.0,'kl-cl-03','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"@cybercrime_alert_kl","author_id":"cybercrime_alert_kl","engagement":{"likes":5,"comments":10,"shares":0,"views":280,"forwards":8},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.6,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["Bitcoin","blockchain","crypto wallet","KYC","dark web","ED"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '23 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-25','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-02','https://manoramaonline.com/news/kerala/hawala-exploitation-network','Hawala network funding exploitation operations','Manorama Online: NIA and Kerala Police joint investigation uncovers hawala network channeling funds for exploitation material production and distribution. Money routed through Dubai and Bangladesh. 4 hawala operators arrested in Malappuram. Rs 25 lakh cash seized. Connection to Telegram channel operations confirmed.', md5('kl-ci-25'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '20 days',80.0,'kl-cl-03','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"Manorama Online","author_id":"kl-src-02","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.65,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["hawala","NIA","Malappuram","Dubai","Bangladesh","Telegram"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '20 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-26','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-14','http://ahmia.onion/payment-methods-csam','Dark web forum discusses payment methods','Dark web forum thread discussing payment methods for exploitation material: Monero preferred (privacy coin), Bitcoin accepted with mixing, UPI via mule accounts (Indian market only). Forum admin warns against direct bank transfers. Thread has 150+ replies with operational details. Handle: @darkmod_admin (same as Discord server admin).', md5('kl-ci-26'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '18 days',5.0,'kl-cl-03','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"Dark Web Monitor","author_id":"kl-src-14","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.9,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["Monero","Bitcoin","UPI","mule accounts","payment","dark web"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '18 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-27','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-07','https://t.me/online_safety_watch_in/230','UPI mule account pattern identified','PATTERN: Exploitation payment mule accounts use specific pattern — newly created UPI IDs, small amounts (Rs 99-499, below bank monitoring threshold), burst transfers followed by withdrawal, account abandoned within 2 weeks. UPI ID pattern: random_name_digits@paytm. Phone: +91-94960-44444 linked to 3 mule accounts.', md5('kl-ci-27'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '15 days',18.0,'kl-cl-03','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"@online_safety_watch_in","author_id":"online_safety_watch_in","engagement":{"likes":8,"comments":15,"shares":0,"views":380,"forwards":10},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.7,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["UPI","mule account","pattern","threshold","burst transfers"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '15 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-28','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-04','https://ndtv.com/kerala-news/ed-freezes-accounts','ED freezes 23 bank accounts linked to exploitation trade','NDTV: Enforcement Directorate freezes 23 bank accounts across Kerala, Tamil Nadu, and Karnataka linked to child exploitation material trade. Total frozen amount: Rs 45 lakh. Investigation triggered by Cyber Dome referral. PMLA provisions applied. Coordination with RBI and NPCI for UPI transaction forensics.', md5('kl-ci-28'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '13 days',82.0,'kl-cl-03','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"NDTV","author_id":"kl-src-04","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.4,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["ED","bank accounts","frozen","PMLA","RBI","NPCI","UPI forensics"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '13 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-29','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-08','https://t.me/pocso_tracker_kl/90','Crypto-to-UPI conversion service','INTEL: Suspect operating crypto-to-UPI conversion service for exploitation material buyers. Accepts Bitcoin/Monero, converts to INR, transfers via UPI to seller accounts. Commission: 15%. Handle: @crypto_convert_in. Operates on Telegram with referral-only access. Phone: +91-94960-44444.', md5('kl-ci-29'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '10 days',20.0,'kl-cl-03','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"@pocso_tracker_kl","author_id":"pocso_tracker_kl","engagement":{"likes":6,"comments":12,"shares":0,"views":310,"forwards":8},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.75,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["crypto","UPI","conversion","Bitcoin","Monero","Telegram"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '10 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-30','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-05','https://indianexpress.com/kerala-crypto-tracking','Kerala Police builds crypto tracking capability','Indian Express: Kerala Police Cyber Dome builds in-house cryptocurrency tracking capability. Partnership with blockchain analytics firms. Can now trace Bitcoin, Ethereum, and partial Monero transactions. First successful conviction using crypto evidence in POCSO case. Training 20 officers in blockchain forensics.', md5('kl-ci-30'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '7 days',80.0,'kl-cl-03','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"Indian Express","author_id":"kl-src-05","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":0.3,"label":"positive"},"keywords":["cryptocurrency","tracking","blockchain","forensics","conviction","training"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '7 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-31','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-03','https://mathrubhumi.com/news/kerala/gaming-currency-laundering','Gaming currency used for exploitation payments','Mathrubhumi investigation: Suspects using in-game virtual currency (Roblox Robux, Free Fire diamonds) as alternative payment for exploitation material. Converts real money to game currency, transfers to suspect account, suspect cashes out via third-party sites. Difficult to trace. 5 such transactions identified by Cyber Dome.', md5('kl-ci-31'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '4 days',78.0,'kl-cl-03','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"Mathrubhumi","author_id":"kl-src-03","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.5,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["gaming currency","Roblox","Robux","Free Fire","laundering","virtual currency"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '4 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-32','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-09','https://cyberdome.kerala.gov.in/financial-intelligence-unit','Cyber Dome financial intelligence unit established','Kerala Police Cyber Dome establishes dedicated financial intelligence unit for tracking exploitation-related money flows. Integrates with FIU-IND, NPCI, and cryptocurrency exchanges. Automated suspicious transaction pattern detection. Unit has frozen Rs 1.2 crore across 45 accounts in first quarter of operation.', md5('kl-ci-32'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '2 days',92.0,'kl-cl-03','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"Kerala Cyber Dome","author_id":"kl-src-09","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":0.1,"label":"neutral"},"keywords":["financial intelligence","FIU-IND","NPCI","cryptocurrency","pattern detection","frozen accounts"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '2 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),

