('kl-ci-33','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-09','https://cyberdome.kerala.gov.in/engine-c-identity-correlation','Cross-platform identity correlation breakthrough','Kerala Cyber Dome cross-platform identity correlation: Same suspect identified across 4 platforms using Engine C identifier intelligence. Telegram handle @darkmod_admin → Discord server admin → dark web forum poster → crypto wallet owner. Phone number +91-94960-11111 appears on Instagram, WhatsApp, and Telegram. Single suspect behind 3 separate reported incidents.', md5('kl-ci-33'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '22 days',92.0,'kl-cl-04','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"Kerala Cyber Dome","author_id":"kl-src-09","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.3,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["cross-platform","identity","Engine C","Telegram","Discord","dark web"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '22 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-34','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-06','https://t.me/cybercrime_alert_kl/112','Identifier cluster reveals network','BREAKTHROUGH: Identifier clustering reveals network of 5 connected suspects. Phone +91-94960-11111 found in 4 content items across 3 platforms. Same email (fake_email_suspect@proton.me) registered on dark web forum and crypto exchange. Forwarding chain analysis shows information flow between Telegram channels.', md5('kl-ci-34'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '19 days',22.0,'kl-cl-04','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"@cybercrime_alert_kl","author_id":"cybercrime_alert_kl","engagement":{"likes":10,"comments":18,"shares":0,"views":420,"forwards":12},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.5,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["identifier","clustering","network","phone","email","forwarding chain"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '19 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-35','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-02','https://manoramaonline.com/news/kerala/suspect-multi-platform','Suspect arrested after multi-platform correlation','Manorama Online: Kozhikode man arrested after Cyber Dome multi-platform correlation linked his Telegram handle, Instagram account, and WhatsApp number to exploitation material distribution. Engine C identifier intelligence correlated handle @safe_gamer_mentor across 3 platforms. Device forensics revealed 8,000+ images. POCSO + IT Act charges.', md5('kl-ci-35'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '16 days',80.0,'kl-cl-04','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"Manorama Online","author_id":"kl-src-02","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.6,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["multi-platform","correlation","Kozhikode","Engine C","device forensics","POCSO"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '16 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-36','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-07','https://t.me/online_safety_watch_in/235','Email address links dark web to real identity','INTEL: Email address fake_email_suspect@proton.me found on dark web exploitation forum also used for Flipkart and Swiggy accounts. Delivery addresses reveal real-world identity. Shared with Cyber Dome for physical surveillance. Cross-referencing with phone +91-94960-22222.', md5('kl-ci-36'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '13 days',18.0,'kl-cl-04','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"@online_safety_watch_in","author_id":"online_safety_watch_in","engagement":{"likes":7,"comments":12,"shares":0,"views":310,"forwards":9},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.5,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["email","dark web","identity","Flipkart","Swiggy","surveillance"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '13 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-37','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-01','https://thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/interpol-coordination','Kerala-Interpol coordination on cross-border suspects','The Hindu: Kerala Cyber Dome coordinates with Interpol ICSE (International Child Sexual Exploitation) database. 12 hash matches found between Kerala tipline submissions and existing Interpol records. 3 suspects identified as part of international network. Red corner notice requested for 1 suspect who fled to UAE.', md5('kl-ci-37'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '10 days',85.0,'kl-cl-04','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"The Hindu","author_id":"kl-src-01","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.4,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["Interpol","ICSE","hash matching","Red corner","UAE","international"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '10 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-38','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-08','https://t.me/pocso_tracker_kl/92','Telegram forwarding chain maps distribution network','Telegram forwarding chain analysis maps distribution network: Channel A (@darkmod_admin) → Channel B → Channel C. Messages forwarded with consistent 2-3 hour delay suggesting automated bot redistribution. Bot handle: @auto_fwd_bot_xyz. Source channel has 500+ subscribers. Downstream channels smaller but growing.', md5('kl-ci-38'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '7 days',20.0,'kl-cl-04','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"@pocso_tracker_kl","author_id":"pocso_tracker_kl","engagement":{"likes":5,"comments":10,"shares":0,"views":250,"forwards":7},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.6,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["forwarding chain","Telegram","distribution","bot","automated","subscribers"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '7 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-39','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-04','https://ndtv.com/kerala-news/device-forensics-network','Device forensics reveals 15-person network','NDTV: Digital forensics on devices seized during Operation Shield reveals 15-person network across 4 states. Contact lists, chat histories, and shared media analyzed using Anveshak platform. Network topology mapped — 2 kingpins, 5 distributors, 8 consumers. Identifier correlation critical for mapping connections.', md5('kl-ci-39'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '4 days',82.0,'kl-cl-04','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"NDTV","author_id":"kl-src-04","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.5,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["device forensics","Operation Shield","network","topology","kingpins","identifier correlation"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '4 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-40','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-05','https://indianexpress.com/kerala-entity-graph','Entity graph connects 50 suspects across Kerala','Indian Express: Cyber Dome entity relationship graph connects 50 suspects across Kerala in exploitation investigation. Graph built from identifier intelligence — shared phone numbers, common Telegram channels, overlapping crypto wallets. Visualization helps investigators prioritize targets. 8 high-connectivity suspects identified for immediate action.', md5('kl-ci-40'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '2 days',80.0,'kl-cl-04','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"Indian Express","author_id":"kl-src-05","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.3,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["entity graph","suspects","identifier intelligence","phone numbers","Telegram","crypto wallets"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '2 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),

