('kl-ci-41','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-10','https://ncpcr.gov.in/pocso-statistics-kerala-q1','NCPCR POCSO statistics Kerala Q1 2026','NCPCR statistics: Kerala registered 342 POCSO cases in Q1 2026, 28% involving online exploitation (up from 15% in Q1 2025). Conviction rate: 42%. Average case duration: 18 months. Cyber Dome evidence quality cited as factor in higher conviction rates for online cases vs traditional cases.', md5('kl-ci-41'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '20 days',90.0,'kl-cl-05','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"NCPCR","author_id":"kl-src-10","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.3,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["NCPCR","POCSO","statistics","conviction rate","online exploitation","evidence"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '20 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-42','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-02','https://manoramaonline.com/news/kerala/cwc-rescue-operation','CWC rescue operation saves 8 children','Manorama Online: Child Welfare Committee Ernakulam conducts rescue operation based on Cyber Dome intelligence. 8 children rescued from exploitation situation in Kochi. Investigation started from cybertipline report, Anveshak platform correlated with 3 prior reports from same location. Accused arrested under POCSO.', md5('kl-ci-42'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '18 days',80.0,'kl-cl-05','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"Manorama Online","author_id":"kl-src-02","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":-0.4,"label":"negative"},"keywords":["CWC","rescue","Ernakulam","Kochi","cybertipline","POCSO"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '18 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-43','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-13','https://youtube.com/watch?v=safe_internet_kl','Kerala Police safe internet campaign for children','Kerala Police YouTube: Safe Internet campaign targeting children. Interactive video explaining online safety — what to share, what not to share, how to report. 1 million views. Available in Malayalam, English, Tamil. Schools mandated to screen. Childline 1098 and cybertipline reporting mechanisms explained.', md5('kl-ci-43'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '15 days',88.0,'kl-cl-05','{"classification":"OPEN","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"Kerala Police Official","author_id":"kl-src-13","engagement":{"likes":5600,"comments":890,"shares":2100,"views":1000000},"sentiment":{"compound":0.6,"label":"positive"},"keywords":["safe internet","campaign","children","Malayalam","Childline","reporting"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '15 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-44','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-03','https://mathrubhumi.com/news/kerala/school-counselor-training','2000 school counselors trained in cyber safety','Mathrubhumi: Kerala Education Department trains 2000 school counselors in identifying signs of online exploitation. Training conducted by Cyber Dome officers. Counselors equipped with reporting protocols. Red flag indicators: behavioral changes, secretive phone use, unexplained gifts or money. Hotline: +91-94960-55555.', md5('kl-ci-44'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '12 days',78.0,'kl-cl-05','{"classification":"OPEN","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"Mathrubhumi","author_id":"kl-src-03","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":0.4,"label":"positive"},"keywords":["school counselors","training","Cyber Dome","red flags","hotline","reporting"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '12 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-45','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-07','https://t.me/online_safety_watch_in/240','Victim support network established','Kerala establishes multi-agency victim support network: Childline 1098 → Police SHO → CWC → Cyber Dome forensics → DCPU counseling → legal aid. Response time target: 2 hours from report to CWC notification. Phone: +91-94960-55555 for direct Cyber Dome reporting.', md5('kl-ci-45'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '10 days',18.0,'kl-cl-05','{"classification":"OPEN","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"@online_safety_watch_in","author_id":"online_safety_watch_in","engagement":{"likes":56,"comments":30,"shares":0,"views":1100,"forwards":28},"sentiment":{"compound":0.3,"label":"positive"},"keywords":["victim support","Childline","CWC","DCPU","counseling","reporting"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '10 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-46','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-01','https://thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/pocso-court-verdict','Kerala POCSO court delivers landmark verdict','The Hindu: Kerala POCSO special court delivers landmark verdict — 20-year sentence for online exploitation case. Digital evidence from Cyber Dome forensics lab accepted as primary evidence. Court commends quality of hash-matching evidence and cross-platform correlation report. Sets precedent for future online exploitation cases.', md5('kl-ci-46'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '8 days',85.0,'kl-cl-05','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"The Hindu","author_id":"kl-src-01","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":0.2,"label":"positive"},"keywords":["POCSO court","verdict","sentence","digital evidence","hash matching","precedent"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '8 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-47','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-09','https://cyberdome.kerala.gov.in/quarterly-report-q1','Cyber Dome Q1 2026 child protection quarterly report','Kerala Cyber Dome Q1 2026 quarterly report: 1,247 cybertipline reports processed (340% YoY increase). 42 arrests. 23 children rescued. Rs 1.2 crore frozen. 3 international referrals to Interpol. AI detection capabilities: 200+ images/day processed. Platform cooperation: WhatsApp (response time 4h), Instagram (24h), Telegram (48h).', md5('kl-ci-47'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '5 days',92.0,'kl-cl-05','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"Kerala Cyber Dome","author_id":"kl-src-09","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":0.1,"label":"neutral"},"keywords":["quarterly report","cybertipline","arrests","rescued","frozen","platform cooperation"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '5 days',NOW(),'org_cyber'),
('kl-ci-48','kl-cyd-001','kl-src-04','https://ndtv.com/kerala-news/cyber-dome-model','Kerala Cyber Dome becomes national model for child protection','NDTV: Central government recognizes Kerala Cyber Dome as national model for online child protection. MHA recommends other states adopt similar AI-driven investigation support platforms. Special mention of cross-platform identifier correlation and deepfake detection capabilities. Budget allocation of Rs 50 crore for nationwide replication.', md5('kl-ci-48'),'en',NOW()-INTERVAL '2 days',82.0,'kl-cl-05','{"classification":"SECRET","domain":"child_protection","owner_org":"cyber","author_handle":"NDTV","author_id":"kl-src-04","engagement":{"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"views":0},"sentiment":{"compound":0.5,"label":"positive"},"keywords":["national model","MHA","AI-driven","identifier correlation","deepfake","replication"]}'::jsonb,NOW()-INTERVAL '2 days',NOW(),'org_cyber')
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;

